{"id":"f7be4b80a43cd8c3","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-categoricity.md","title":"Categoricity","display":"df-categoricity — Categoricity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-categoricity","aliases":["93-df-categoricity"],"display":"df-categoricity — Categoricity","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","[[93-df-model]]","[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","[[93-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-categoricity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-categoricity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-categoricity — Categoricity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30a8f872911e731f\" href=\"?note=30a8f872911e731f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-theory\">93-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1734624324342672\" href=\"?note=1734624324342672\" title=\"93-df-cardinality\">93-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{CardEq}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1734624324342672\" href=\"?note=1734624324342672\" title=\"93-df-cardinality\">93-df-cardinality</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}\\)</span> is first-order isomorphism.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Categorical}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Categorical}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity}\\vdash\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{CardEq}(|\\mathfrak A|,\\kappa)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity}\\vdash\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{CardEq}(|\\mathfrak A|,\\kappa)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity}\\vdash\\mathrm{Categorical}_{93}(T,\\kappa;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\;\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\;\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}(h,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity}\\vdash\\mathrm{Categorical}_{93}(T,\\kappa;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\;\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\;\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}(h,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The language is an explicit argument, the class is required to be nonempty, and equality of cardinalities is expressed by the local bijection-based predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"1734624324342672","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"1734624324342672","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardEq}$ and $\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-cardinality]], and $\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}$ is first-order isomorphism.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Categorical}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity}\\vdash\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{CardEq}(|\\mathfrak A|,\\kappa)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity}\\vdash\\mathrm{Categorical}_{93}(T,\\kappa;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\;\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Mod}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\kappa}(T)\\;\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}(h,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1590,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["cc9bc888c7dda430","30a8f872911e731f","2e6273b8ebf2e31a","0ce709e0d2857990","1734624324342672"]}